flowchart LR
  S[Source Connector] --> RUN[Ingestion Run]
  RUN --> R[Raw Record + rights snapshot]
  R --> V[Validate]
  V --> N[Normalize]
  N --> E[Resolve Organization / Venue]
  E --> GEO[Geocode]
  GEO --> EO[Map Event vs EventOccurrence]
  EO --> D[Dedupe candidates]
  D -->|new| C[Canonical Event / Occurrence upsert]
  D -->|high-confidence duplicate| M[Merge/link]
  D -->|medium| Q[Admin dedupe queue]
  Q --> M
  M --> AL[Create/flatten stable alias + preserve provenance]
  AL --> C
  C --> T[Translate / Moderate]
  T --> P[Publish physical occurrence projection]
  P --> F[Feed / Search / Map]

  Ticket[Admission data\nexternal ticket/free] --> C
  Social[Meet Participation policy\nindependent] --> C
